WEBVTT

00:00:00.104 --> 00:00:10.184
This video shows the attendance register on your phone. You will pick a class, move between months, read the register, and download it as a PDF.

00:00:14.251 --> 00:00:23.875
Tap the menu button at the top left, open Attendance, and then choose Attendance Record. This is where the saved attendance of every class is kept.

00:00:24.947 --> 00:00:31.619
Choose a class from the list to see its register. The register for the current month then loads.

00:00:33.354 --> 00:00:43.434
Use the arrows next to the month name to go to the previous month, or back to the next one. This is useful when you need to check what happened earlier in the term.

00:00:46.565 --> 00:00:57.029
Scroll down to read the register. Each student has a row, each day has a column, and every cell shows the mark that was saved for that student on that day.

00:01:01.540 --> 00:01:09.916
To keep a copy, tap Download Register PDF. The register is saved to your phone, ready to print or share.

00:01:14.966 --> 00:01:19.094
Your attendance register is ready to read, print or share.
